    "slug": "geth-prime",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 12
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Geth Primes are the most powerful and elite geth infantry platforms, standing approximately twelve feet tall with white armor. They carry a heavy pulse rifle capable of launching rockets, possess very strong shields and heavy armor, and wield a suite of tech abilities.</p><p>Geth Primes boost the combat capabilities of nearby geth units while jamming enemy radar. Eliminating them quickly significantly degrades the effectiveness of surrounding geth forces.</p>",
